Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [FAS] Add INFRA in native to provide FPS
 Sampling and callback

P.S. When testing this feature I noticed the sampled FPS data is different from one in Scene(com.omarea.vtools) 9.4.11
 e.g. in Minecraft this sampler reports 120FPS while Scene reports 60

I got in touch with Scene Dev and he claimed that Scene sampled from wrong layer

